    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "21 Millrace Road, Phoenix Park Racecourse, Castleknock, Dublin 15\n\n\nA Superb 2-Bedroom, 2-Bathroom Ground-Floor Apartment in an Exclusive Castleknock Setting\n\n\nGARY WILDMAN/CKP Presents in excellent condition throughout No. 21 Millrace Road, a modern ground-floor two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment positioned in one of Castleknock`s most sought-after residential developments. Situated in an intimate, low-density block of just 10 units built c. 2004, this apartment offers privacy, convenience and low-maintenance living - ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors alike.\n\nAccommodation Brief\n\nEntrance Hallway: Generous hall featuring wood flooring, a storage closet and a separate hot press.\nLiving / Dining Area: Bright, open-plan space filled with natural light, finished with timber flooring and direct access to outdoor space.\nKitchen: Contemporary fully fitted kitchen featuring modern units and integrated appliances.\nMaster Bedroom & En-Suite: Spacious double bedroom with custom fitted wardrobes and a tiled en-suite shower room.\nBedroom 2: Large double bedroom with built-in wardrobes, ideal as a guest room or home office.\nMain Bathroom: Stylish family bathroom complete with bath/shower combination, WC and wash hand basin.\n\nLocation & Amenities\n\nLocated in the Phoenix Park Racecourse development, the property sits directly adjacent to the gates of the Phoenix Park, offering over 1,700 acres of parkland right on your doorstep.\n\nTransport: A short walk to Ashtown Train Station and Navan Road Parkway, along with prime bus routes (38, 39, 70) offering swift access to Dublin City Centre. Immediate connectivity to the N3, M3, and M50 networks.\nLocal Amenities: Minutes from Castleknock Village and Ashtown, providing easy access to cafes, restaurants, bars, pharmacies and supermarkets.\n\n\nKey Features\n\nGround-Floor Convenience: Easy level access in an intimate block of only 10 apartments.\nExcellent Condition: Meticulously maintained and ready for immediate occupation.\nHeating System: Gas Fired Central Heating (GFCH).\nParking:Designated, secure underground parking space plus visitor parking.\nLow-Density Block: Built c. 2004 set within beautifully landscaped grounds.\nPrime Location: Minutes from Ashtown Station, Phoenix Park, and Castleknock Village.\n\nTo make an appointment to view please contact gary@ckp.ie https://youtube.com/shorts/WTlg6p1xTgo"
      },
